# This is documentation only. `phase-2-live-setup.sh prepare` generates the
# private mode-0600 bundle outside this repository; do not copy or hand-edit it.
#
# Closed generated fields: RUN_ID, WORKSPACE, IMAGE_DIGEST, IMAGE_ARCHIVE_FILE,
# IMAGE_CONTRACT_FILE, seven materialized credential/public-key references,
# SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS_FILE, the verified recovery dump/provenance references, and
# the seven exact repository-owned *_RUNNER mappings.
#
# The only operator-provided setup selections are separate mode-0600 external
# JSON documents:
#   candidate-selection.json: version 1 plus the immutable OCI archive path and
#   its archive/config/manifest/revision/architecture/rootfs facts.
#   recovery-selection.json: version 1 plus one b2-primary or r2-mirror source
#   and verified external dump/provenance paths.
#
# No command fields, provider/DNS/destroy approvals, change trigger, or private
# key path belongs in this contract. The matching public identity must already
# be available through SSH_AUTH_SOCK when preparation runs.
